    "date_str": "2026-03-04",
    "description": "President Anura Kumara Dissanayake states in Parliament that Sri Lanka has sufficient fuel stocks at present despite the escalating conflict in the Middle East:Diesel cover for 33 days, petrol 28 days (rising to 40 days), and aviation fuel 49 days,Crude oil for 26 days",
    "url_metadata": "https://dbsjeyaraj.com/dbsj/?p=87194",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dbsjeyarajcom",
    "time_ut": 1772573400.0,
    "chunk_id": "2026-03-04-dbsjeyarajcom-d3913719-0000",
    "chunk_index": 0,
